#: scenario5:scenario5_75C07A29_C01E_4B8A_89D6_B8CBC2D40686
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fd81a4fe358eb1552cd835b55bcd90dd468b04dce11b4ff6dcc08e019ae65f0
#. default-sha256: 718c7b150da1e08ca12a4d2592c61acf8ae1d8323b72a78a7e16354adb33c0bc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75C07A29_C01E_4B8A_89D6_B8CBC2D40686"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Giselle didn’t recover for some time "
"after I managed to get her inside. ⟪k:11⟫Unsure what else I could do for her,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Après avoir réussi à la faire rentrer, "
"j’eus beaucoup de mal à remettre Giselle sur pied. ⟪k:11⟫Ne sachant ce que je pouvais faire "
"d’autre pour elle,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E3A5592_8060_41EB_BC69_E08FE5260F40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6229675832cc4be12903199de8123a57123ae7f8927f4a244ce928c596a69745
#. default-sha256: f15af21d4c6ab575396a09acf45ff242bc01ac51f8167135413e5e18a769e10c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E3A5592_8060_41EB_BC69_E08FE5260F40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had her sit before the fireplace and waited in silence as she sobbed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫je la fis asseoir près du feu et j’attendis en silence tandis qu’elle sanglotait."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5F59D36_BBD5_4935_BED2_38B5B1977943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58bc1e6b838031739a941ed4b72e74998f30317b4c9f9e850f7807bba261e977
#. default-sha256: f386d3e23e19e766de274aec6e8e6a2e35c4992162d27d3b17efe7b5ccb9a511
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5F59D36_BBD5_4935_BED2_38B5B1977943"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no idea what one was supposed to say to someone who was crying."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je ne savais absolument pas ce qu’on était censé dire à quelqu’un qui pleurait."

#: scenario5:scenario5_133846E6_A6C0_4A08_9035_F8D79CDAA20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 975baf9e733e7b04545369994d0b2463c65670ec018d081c3f31691f99374dad
#. default-sha256: 961f46e4538997edb20b9813256d31ef72266a87d43299d4ac9ba922a9bd5663
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_133846E6_A6C0_4A08_9035_F8D79CDAA20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Was it normal to offer them a warm drink? ⟪k:1⟫I didn’t know."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫É⟪k:2⟫tait-ce normal d’offrir une boisson chaude ? ⟪k:3⟫Je n’en savais rien."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A50EF3F8_025D_4A44_B855_E041CE1DBF29
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 241bbe288ef80312062bbbcde5e0d10f91932d8048a4665c0fd44865560f8e1e
#. default-sha256: b442c14cc7e6ac25e3086a4c0e1cda2b467a8e02c1d6847cace53d83182e91a4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A50EF3F8_025D_4A44_B855_E041CE1DBF29"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫did⟪k:2⟫ know I needed to reflect on the things she had said outside and try to make "
"sense of them,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ⟪k:1⟫savais⟪k:2⟫ qu’il me fallait réfléchir à ce qu’elle avait dit à l’extérieur et "
"essayer d’y trouver du sens,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_41884D0C_E62C_4552_9297_0CB1123236FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8def3145b0c3442d00cd73feaff5487d605aacb6ca19212ae6cd97bacdbc12e9
#. default-sha256: b4a5361d27ae82804148c231131e17c7c41793ff58f146e7b02862cddf0b0f87
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_41884D0C_E62C_4552_9297_0CB1123236FF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and from there, calm myself down and prepare for the conversation we were to have—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"as unpleasant as I was sure it would be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫puis que je devais ensuite me calmer et me préparer pour la conversation que nous allions "
"avoir—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ aussi désagréable qu’elle promettait d’être."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F7385662_6EF7_4B14_BBFC_FE0FF5D9D8FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab73b60e91c62b853b7b27cf18d1d71e87721597fa8207d6d0a373ad68eb509d
#. default-sha256: 86b187669102b9f37319cbbc3023170f6253ad772a1fae53f40d9c8fc17999df
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F7385662_6EF7_4B14_BBFC_FE0FF5D9D8FB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...A considerable amount of time later, Giselle’s sobbing drew to a stop, an oppressive "
"silence stepping in to take its place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Après un long moment, les sanglots de Giselle arrivèrent à leur fin et un silence "
"oppressant vint prendre la place."

