#: scenario5:scenario5_3E162B84_873A_4674_91CC_E3B88D707B3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bed68547c906e0a0d1f77555d212d9461bfbba950c3db4d8d1d9fc9ac106a95e
#. default-sha256: 9b637f2bbe85e895627bb585b9c97fb69ebf602fe8cddfe84146d55b9ee511f1
