#: scenario5:scenario5_0C4432C5_4125_4ADD_B0B3_F2A8BF3982BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b3d6867faa637a45a881102d3f720cbe218820eca537fc991c5074958ba982a
